<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Inhale Therapeutic started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Inhale Therapeutic started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens said analyst Donald Ellis initiated coverage of Inhale Therapeutic Systems with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Inhale is developing a pulmonary drug delivery system for the deep lung delivery of macromolecules.</p>
<p>-- Its shares were up 3-1/8 at 16-3/4.</p>
</text>
